{"book": "MRK", "chapter": 14, "lang": "es", "bible": "RV1909-2026", "engine": "chatterbox-videos-v1", "durationMs": 598972, "verses": [{"verse": 1, "start": 300, "end": 11758, "text": "Y dos días después era la Pascua y la fiesta de los panes sin levadura: y buscaban los principales sacerdotes y los escribas cómo le prenderían con engaño, y le matarían.", "words": [[0, 300], [2, 426], [6, 606], [11, 906], [19, 1306], [23, 1766], [26, 2116], [33, 2466], [35, 2526], [38, 2606], [45, 3006], [48, 3146], [52, 3286], [58, 3826], [62, 3966], [72, 5107], [74, 5212], [83, 5712], [87, 5852], [99, 6532], [110, 7232], [112, 7372], [116, 7512], [125, 8132], [130, 8692], [133, 8912], [144, 9552], [148, 9732], [156, 10372], [158, 10852], [161, 10952]]}, {"verse": 2, "start": 12208, "end": 16976, "text": "Y decían: No en el día de la fiesta, porque no se haga alboroto del pueblo.", "words": [[0, 12208], [2, 12430], [10, 13459], [13, 13640], [16, 13800], [19, 13900], [23, 14060], [26, 14180], [29, 14280], [37, 15020], [44, 15220], [47, 15400], [50, 15600], [55, 15940], [64, 16280], [68, 16440]]}, {"verse": 3, "start": 17326, "end": 33953, "text": "Y estando él en Betania en casa de Simón el leproso, y sentado a la mesa, vino una mujer teniendo un frasco de alabastro con perfume de nardo puro muy costoso; y rompiendo el frasco, se lo derramó sobre su cabeza.", "words": [[0, 17326], [2, 17490], [10, 18010], [13, 18390], [16, 18670], [24, 19490], [27, 19590], [32, 19830], [35, 20050], [41, 20990], [44, 21110], [53, 22130], [55, 22230], [63, 22710], [65, 22790], [68, 22870], [74, 23674], [79, 23960], [83, 24240], [89, 24580], [98, 25460], [101, 25600], [108, 26040], [111, 26160], [121, 26720], [125, 26920], [133, 27420], [136, 27680], [142, 28120], [147, 28500], [151, 28740], [160, 29867], [162, 29992], [172, 30612], [175, 30792], [183, 31812], [186, 32092], [189, 32232], [197, 32792], [203, 33052], [206, 33252]]}, {"verse": 4, "start": 34403, "end": 40881, "text": "Y hubo algunos que se enojaron dentro de sí, y dijeron: ¿Para qué se ha hecho este desperdicio de perfume?", "words": [[0, 34403], [2, 34684], [7, 34984], [15, 35344], [19, 35584], [22, 35744], [31, 36344], [38, 36644], [41, 36944], [45, 37184], [47, 37424], [56, 38436], [62, 38598], [66, 38778], [69, 38958], [72, 39078], [78, 39258], [83, 39498], [95, 40098], [98, 40218]]}, {"verse": 5, "start": 41331, "end": 48485, "text": "Porque podía esto ser vendido por más de trescientos denarios, y darse a los pobres. Y murmuraban contra ella.", "words": [[0, 41331], [7, 41496], [13, 41876], [18, 42156], [22, 42396], [30, 42856], [34, 43076], [38, 43236], [41, 43506], [53, 43776], [63, 44536], [65, 45056], [71, 45416], [73, 45476], [77, 45596], [85, 46552], [87, 46677], [98, 47457], [105, 47917]]}, {"verse": 6, "start": 48935, "end": 55486, "text": "Pero Jesús dijo: Dejadla; ¿por qué la molestáis? Ha hecho una buena obra conmigo;", "words": [[0, 48935], [5, 49085], [11, 49425], [17, 50552], [26, 51628], [31, 51753], [35, 51893], [38, 52013], [49, 53403], [52, 53664], [58, 53864], [62, 54044], [68, 54284], [73, 54604]]}, {"verse": 7, "start": 55936, "end": 65217, "text": "Que siempre tendréis los pobres con vosotros, y cuando queráis les podréis hacer bien; pero a mí no siempre me tendréis.", "words": [[0, 55936], [4, 56018], [12, 56438], [21, 57178], [25, 57338], [32, 57878], [36, 58138], [46, 58738], [48, 59198], [55, 59418], [63, 60038], [67, 60378], [75, 61098], [81, 61418], [87, 63234], [92, 63377], [94, 63517], [97, 63657], [100, 63797], [108, 64077], [111, 64377]]}, {"verse": 8, "start": 65667, "end": 72356, "text": "Esta ha hecho lo que podía; porque se ha anticipado a ungir mi cuerpo para la sepultura.", "words": [[0, 65667], [5, 66003], [8, 66343], [14, 66663], [17, 66843], [21, 66983], [28, 68003], [35, 68207], [38, 68447], [41, 68607], [52, 69787], [54, 70077], [60, 70367], [63, 70587], [70, 70927], [75, 71247], [78, 71407]]}, {"verse": 9, "start": 72806, "end": 83703, "text": "De cierto os digo que dondequiera que se predique este evangelio en todo el mundo, también se contará, en memoria de esta mujer, lo que ella ha hecho.", "words": [[0, 72806], [3, 73012], [10, 73412], [13, 73812], [18, 74212], [22, 74872], [34, 75532], [38, 75732], [41, 75892], [50, 76512], [55, 76892], [65, 77632], [68, 77752], [73, 78012], [76, 78232], [83, 78952], [91, 79212], [94, 79532], [103, 80112], [106, 80632], [114, 81132], [117, 81352], [122, 81572], [129, 81972], [132, 82412], [136, 82552], [141, 82832], [144, 83152]]}, {"verse": 10, "start": 84153, "end": 92080, "text": "Entonces Judas Iscariote, uno de los doce, vino a los príncipes de los sacerdotes, para entregársele.", "words": [[0, 84153], [9, 85155], [15, 85595], [26, 86575], [30, 86815], [33, 86955], [37, 87095], [43, 87915], [48, 88155], [50, 88315], [54, 88435], [64, 89155], [67, 89275], [71, 89395], [83, 90155], [88, 91151]]}, {"verse": 11, "start": 92530, "end": 100924, "text": "Y ellos al oírlo se alegraron, y prometieron que le darían dinero. Y buscaba oportunidad cómo le entregaría.", "words": [[0, 92530], [2, 92696], [8, 93036], [11, 93196], [17, 93976], [20, 94096], [31, 94816], [33, 95176], [45, 95836], [49, 96016], [52, 96136], [59, 96576], [67, 97636], [69, 97762], [77, 98262], [89, 99142], [94, 99722], [97, 99902]]}, {"verse": 12, "start": 101374, "end": 114163, "text": "Y el primer día de los panes sin levadura, cuando sacrificaban el cordero pascual, sus discípulos le dicen: ¿Dónde quieres que vayamos a preparar para que comas la pascua?", "words": [[0, 101374], [2, 101507], [5, 101627], [12, 102047], [16, 102427], [19, 102607], [23, 102747], [29, 103307], [33, 103707], [43, 104947], [50, 105327], [63, 106307], [66, 106427], [74, 107317], [83, 108207], [87, 108407], [98, 109367], [101, 109767], [108, 110822], [115, 111099], [123, 111439], [127, 111659], [135, 112079], [137, 112219], [146, 112739], [151, 112919], [155, 113099], [161, 113459], [164, 113559]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 114513, "end": 124530, "text": "Y envía dos de sus discípulos, y les dice: Id a la ciudad, y os encontrará un hombre que lleva un cántaro de agua; seguidle;", "words": [[0, 114513], [2, 114655], [8, 115095], [12, 115635], [15, 116115], [19, 116335], [31, 117095], [33, 117375], [37, 117555], [43, 118441], [46, 118535], [48, 118628], [51, 118768], [59, 119648], [61, 119928], [64, 120048], [75, 120808], [78, 120988], [85, 121288], [89, 121488], [95, 121748], [98, 121988], [106, 122608], [109, 122848], [115, 123736]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 124980, "end": 134178, "text": "Y donde entre, decid al señor de la casa: El Maestro dice: ¿Dónde está el aposento donde he de comer la pascua con mis discípulos?", "words": [[0, 124980], [2, 125237], [8, 125477], [15, 126417], [21, 126877], [24, 127097], [30, 127397], [33, 127637], [36, 127757], [42, 128607], [45, 128745], [53, 129265], [59, 130222], [66, 130547], [71, 130787], [74, 130927], [83, 131467], [89, 131707], [92, 131927], [95, 132047], [101, 132287], [104, 132617], [111, 132947], [115, 133067], [119, 133267]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 134628, "end": 142121, "text": "Y él os mostrará una gran habitación superior ya preparada: preparad para nosotros allí.", "words": [[0, 134628], [2, 134775], [5, 134935], [8, 135155], [17, 136015], [21, 136175], [26, 136435], [37, 137035], [46, 137515], [49, 137915], [60, 139453], [69, 140081], [74, 140421], [83, 140801]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 142571, "end": 149595, "text": "Y fueron sus discípulos, y vinieron a la ciudad, y hallaron como les había dicho; y prepararon la pascua.", "words": [[0, 142571], [2, 142692], [9, 142932], [13, 143272], [25, 144032], [27, 144212], [36, 144612], [38, 144772], [41, 144852], [49, 145212], [51, 145532], [60, 146012], [65, 146292], [69, 146492], [75, 146812], [82, 147724], [84, 147833], [95, 148513], [98, 148753]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 150045, "end": 152384, "text": "Y llegada la tarde, fue con los doce.", "words": [[0, 150045], [2, 150155], [10, 150535], [13, 150695], [20, 151015], [24, 151355], [28, 151575], [32, 152010]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 152834, "end": 161720, "text": "Y como se sentaron a la mesa y comiesen, dice Jesús: De cierto os digo que uno de vosotros, que come conmigo, me ha de entregar.", "words": [[0, 152834], [2, 152958], [7, 153258], [10, 153478], [19, 154078], [21, 154218], [24, 154298], [29, 154578], [31, 154738], [41, 155598], [46, 155918], [53, 156938], [56, 157083], [63, 157423], [66, 157803], [71, 158123], [75, 158343], [79, 158543], [82, 158703], [92, 159223], [96, 159643], [101, 159903], [110, 160583], [113, 160903], [116, 160983], [119, 161103]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 162170, "end": 170996, "text": "Entonces ellos comenzaron a entristecerse, y a decirle cada uno por sí: ¿ Seré yo? Y el otro: ¿ Seré yo?", "words": [[0, 162170], [9, 162734], [15, 163214], [26, 164034], [28, 164174], [43, 165254], [45, 165874], [47, 165974], [55, 166554], [60, 166814], [64, 167234], [68, 167534], [72, 168222], [74, 168222], [79, 168565], [83, 169248], [85, 169428], [88, 169548], [94, 170320], [96, 170320], [101, 170663]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 171346, "end": 177059, "text": "Y él respondiendo les dijo: Es uno de los doce que moja conmigo en el plato.", "words": [[0, 171346], [2, 171541], [5, 171681], [18, 172441], [22, 172621], [28, 173396], [31, 173736], [35, 174116], [38, 174316], [42, 174476], [47, 174936], [51, 175136], [56, 175596], [64, 176216], [67, 176336], [70, 176476]]}, {"verse": 21, "start": 177509, "end": 190337, "text": "A la verdad el Hijo del hombre va, como está de él escrito; pero ¡ay de aquel hombre por quien el Hijo del hombre es entregado! bueno le fuera a aquel hombre si nunca hubiera nacido.", "words": [[0, 177509], [2, 177729], [5, 177829], [12, 178169], [15, 178589], [20, 178869], [24, 179009], [31, 179329], [35, 179889], [40, 180169], [45, 180409], [48, 180589], [51, 180749], [60, 181720], [65, 182235], [69, 182785], [72, 182945], [78, 183225], [85, 183485], [89, 183825], [95, 184165], [98, 184645], [103, 184965], [107, 185125], [114, 185465], [117, 185745], [128, 186928], [134, 187255], [137, 187335], [143, 187535], [145, 187895], [151, 188215], [158, 188475], [161, 188735], [167, 189155], [175, 189715]]}, {"verse": 22, "start": 190787, "end": 200330, "text": "Y estando ellos comiendo, tomó Jesús pan, y bendiciendo, partió y les dio, y dijo: Tomad, esto es mi cuerpo.", "words": [[0, 190787], [2, 190924], [10, 191484], [16, 191724], [26, 192664], [31, 193104], [37, 193344], [42, 193864], [44, 194404], [57, 195804], [64, 196504], [66, 196764], [70, 196944], [75, 197284], [77, 197824], [83, 198937], [90, 199317], [95, 199497], [98, 199637], [101, 199737]]}, {"verse": 23, "start": 200780, "end": 207337, "text": "Y tomando la copa, habiendo dado gracias, les dio: y todos bebieron de ella.", "words": [[0, 200780], [2, 200880], [10, 201320], [13, 201500], [19, 202380], [28, 202920], [33, 203160], [42, 203700], [46, 204320], [51, 205150], [53, 205494], [59, 205814], [68, 206614], [71, 206874]]}, {"verse": 24, "start": 207787, "end": 213548, "text": "Y les dice: Esto es mi sangre del nuevo pacto, que por muchos es derramada.", "words": [[0, 207787], [2, 207877], [6, 207997], [12, 209012], [17, 209294], [20, 209474], [23, 209614], [30, 209994], [34, 210274], [40, 210514], [47, 211514], [51, 211574], [55, 211794], [62, 212194], [65, 212514]]}, {"verse": 25, "start": 213998, "end": 221994, "text": "De cierto os digo que no beberé más del fruto de la vid, hasta aquel día cuando lo beba nuevo en el reino de Dios.", "words": [[0, 214183], [3, 214403], [10, 214623], [13, 214823], [18, 215103], [22, 215343], [25, 215603], [32, 216103], [36, 216303], [40, 216543], [46, 217023], [49, 217183], [52, 217353], [57, 217523], [63, 218003], [69, 218483], [73, 218723], [80, 218983], [83, 219283], [88, 219563], [94, 219983], [97, 220363], [100, 220543], [106, 221163], [109, 221343]]}, {"verse": 26, "start": 222444, "end": 226630, "text": "Y después de cantar el himno, salieron al monte de los Olivos.", "words": [[0, 222444], [2, 222572], [10, 222872], [13, 223072], [20, 223552], [23, 223672], [30, 224052], [39, 224872], [42, 225212], [48, 225532], [51, 225772], [55, 225912]]}, {"verse": 27, "start": 227080, "end": 237118, "text": "Jesús entonces les dice: Todos me abandonaréis esta noche; porque escrito está: Heriré al pastor, y serán dispersadas las ovejas.", "words": [[0, 227080], [6, 227425], [15, 228005], [19, 228445], [25, 229349], [31, 229731], [34, 230191], [47, 230971], [52, 231231], [59, 232087], [66, 232374], [74, 232894], [80, 233977], [87, 234207], [90, 234327], [98, 234727], [100, 235247], [106, 235587], [118, 236327], [122, 236527]]}, {"verse": 28, "start": 237568, "end": 242004, "text": "Pero después que haya resucitado, iré delante de vosotros a Galilea.", "words": [[0, 237568], [5, 237714], [13, 238054], [17, 238234], [22, 238434], [34, 239374], [38, 239814], [46, 240434], [49, 240594], [58, 241074], [60, 241314]]}, {"verse": 29, "start": 242454, "end": 246553, "text": "Entonces Pedro le dijo: Aunque todos te abandonen, yo no.", "words": [[0, 242454], [9, 242980], [15, 243520], [18, 243800], [24, 244572], [31, 244788], [37, 245108], [40, 245308], [51, 246208], [54, 246308]]}, {"verse": 30, "start": 246903, "end": 256102, "text": "Y le dice Jesús: De cierto te digo que tú, hoy, en esta noche, antes que el gallo haya cantado dos veces, me negarás tres veces.", "words": [[0, 246903], [2, 247025], [5, 247165], [10, 247485], [17, 248624], [20, 248812], [27, 249132], [30, 249552], [35, 249912], [39, 250132], [43, 250392], [48, 250912], [51, 251112], [56, 251352], [63, 251932], [69, 252232], [73, 252432], [76, 252572], [82, 252912], [87, 253072], [95, 253672], [99, 253872], [106, 254632], [109, 254752], [117, 255212], [122, 255452]]}, {"verse": 31, "start": 256552, "end": 264943, "text": "Pero él con mayor insistencia decía: Si me es necesario morir contigo, no te negaré. También todos decían lo mismo.", "words": [[0, 256552], [5, 256792], [8, 256972], [12, 257192], [18, 257472], [30, 258392], [37, 259366], [40, 259527], [43, 259687], [46, 259827], [56, 260327], [62, 260767], [71, 261807], [74, 261987], [77, 262147], [85, 263008], [93, 263333], [99, 263673], [106, 264273], [109, 264413]]}, {"verse": 32, "start": 265393, "end": 273812, "text": "Y vienen al lugar que se llama Getsemaní, y dice a sus discípulos: Sentaos aquí, entre tanto que yo oro.", "words": [[0, 265393], [2, 265495], [9, 265775], [12, 266115], [18, 266495], [22, 266695], [25, 266875], [31, 267605], [42, 268335], [44, 268755], [49, 269115], [51, 269415], [55, 269635], [67, 271149], [75, 271429], [81, 272249], [87, 272489], [93, 272909], [97, 273109], [100, 273309]]}, {"verse": 33, "start": 274262, "end": 281497, "text": "Y toma consigo a Pedro y a Jacobo y a Juan, y comenzó a sentir temor y profunda angustia.", "words": [[0, 274262], [2, 274384], [7, 274664], [15, 275264], [17, 275564], [23, 275984], [25, 276224], [27, 276304], [34, 276944], [36, 277144], [38, 277204], [44, 277544], [46, 278284], [54, 278864], [56, 278924], [63, 279264], [69, 279824], [71, 279944], [80, 280544]]}, {"verse": 34, "start": 281947, "end": 287873, "text": "Y les dice: Está muy triste mi alma, hasta la muerte: quedaos aquí y velad.", "words": [[0, 281947], [2, 282037], [6, 282157], [12, 283171], [17, 283402], [21, 283642], [28, 284082], [31, 284322], [37, 284642], [43, 285222], [46, 285382], [54, 286309], [62, 286693], [67, 286993], [69, 287353]]}, {"verse": 35, "start": 288323, "end": 296178, "text": "Y yéndose un poco adelante, se postró en tierra, y oró que si fuese posible, pasase de él aquella hora.", "words": [[0, 288500], [2, 288714], [10, 288927], [13, 289087], [18, 289347], [28, 290427], [31, 290507], [38, 291067], [41, 291247], [49, 291707], [51, 292247], [55, 292587], [59, 292767], [62, 292867], [68, 293167], [77, 294267], [84, 294767], [87, 294987], [90, 295227], [98, 295667]]}, {"verse": 36, "start": 296628, "end": 305640, "text": "Y decía: Abba, Padre, todo te es posible; aparta de mí esta copa; pero no lo que yo quiero, sino lo que tú quieres.", "words": [[0, 296628], [2, 296754], [9, 297810], [15, 297960], [22, 298480], [27, 298620], [30, 298840], [33, 298940], [42, 300272], [49, 300572], [52, 300672], [55, 300996], [60, 301321], [66, 301885], [71, 302029], [74, 302229], [77, 302369], [81, 302509], [84, 302669], [92, 303029], [97, 303309], [100, 303509], [104, 303649], [107, 303829]]}, {"verse": 37, "start": 306090, "end": 313021, "text": "Y vino y los halló durmiendo; y dice a Pedro: ¿Simón, duermes? ¿No has podido velar una hora?", "words": [[0, 306090], [2, 306090], [7, 306090], [9, 306187], [13, 306367], [19, 306687], [30, 307858], [32, 308191], [37, 308451], [39, 308631], [46, 309523], [54, 309940], [63, 310981], [67, 311303], [71, 311443], [78, 311883], [84, 312283], [88, 312423]]}, {"verse": 38, "start": 313471, "end": 320626, "text": "Velad y orad, para que no entréis en tentación: el espíritu está dispuesto, pero la carne es débil.", "words": [[0, 313471], [6, 314037], [8, 314237], [14, 314577], [19, 314897], [23, 315057], [26, 315257], [34, 315757], [37, 315917], [48, 317106], [51, 317232], [60, 317752], [65, 317912], [76, 318792], [81, 318932], [84, 319092], [90, 319452], [93, 319932]]}, {"verse": 39, "start": 321076, "end": 325097, "text": "Y volviéndose a ir, oró, y dijo las mismas palabras.", "words": [[0, 321076], [2, 321199], [14, 321819], [16, 321979], [20, 322159], [25, 322759], [27, 323379], [32, 323679], [36, 323839], [43, 324239]]}, {"verse": 40, "start": 325547, "end": 333825, "text": "Y vuelto, los halló otra vez durmiendo, porque los ojos de ellos estaban cargados; y no sabían qué responderle.", "words": [[0, 325547], [2, 325683], [10, 326143], [14, 326303], [20, 326783], [25, 327063], [29, 327343], [40, 328223], [47, 328943], [51, 329163], [56, 329503], [59, 329703], [65, 329883], [73, 330303], [83, 331792], [85, 331897], [88, 332037], [95, 332477], [99, 332737]]}, {"verse": 41, "start": 334275, "end": 346217, "text": "Y vino la tercera vez, y les dice: Dormid ya y descansad: basta, la hora es venida; he aquí, el Hijo del hombre es entregado en manos de los pecadores.", "words": [[0, 334275], [2, 334391], [7, 334591], [10, 334771], [18, 335311], [23, 335491], [25, 335711], [29, 335871], [35, 337524], [42, 337524], [45, 337864], [47, 338537], [58, 339495], [65, 339997], [68, 340077], [73, 340257], [76, 340397], [84, 341315], [87, 341405], [93, 341685], [96, 342105], [101, 342365], [105, 342485], [112, 342865], [115, 343085], [125, 343745], [128, 343845], [134, 344105], [137, 344285], [141, 344385]]}, {"verse": 42, "start": 346667, "end": 350187, "text": "Levantaos, vamos: he aquí, el que me entrega está cerca.", "words": [[0, 346667], [11, 346667], [18, 347733], [21, 347813], [27, 348133], [30, 348573], [34, 348713], [37, 348853], [45, 349353], [50, 349493]]}, {"verse": 43, "start": 350637, "end": 364579, "text": "Y luego, aun hablando él, vino Judas, que era uno de los doce, y con él una multitud con espadas y palos, de parte de los principales sacerdotes, y de los escribas y de los ancianos.", "words": [[0, 350637], [2, 350781], [9, 351281], [13, 351441], [22, 351821], [26, 352621], [31, 352781], [38, 353781], [42, 353861], [46, 354041], [50, 354281], [53, 354441], [57, 354601], [63, 355521], [65, 355621], [69, 355821], [72, 356001], [76, 356321], [85, 357061], [89, 357321], [97, 357781], [99, 357981], [106, 358521], [109, 358841], [115, 359081], [118, 359341], [122, 359441], [134, 360221], [146, 361664], [148, 361786], [151, 361886], [155, 362046], [164, 362806], [166, 363306], [169, 363426], [173, 363586]]}, {"verse": 44, "start": 365029, "end": 373604, "text": "Y el que le entregaba les había dado una señal acordada, diciendo: Al que yo bese, aquel es: prendedle, y llevadle con seguridad.", "words": [[0, 365029], [2, 365156], [5, 365296], [9, 365436], [12, 365596], [22, 366256], [26, 366436], [32, 366756], [37, 367016], [41, 367236], [47, 367696], [57, 368316], [67, 369388], [70, 369508], [74, 369608], [77, 369888], [83, 370168], [89, 370628], [93, 371633], [104, 371933], [106, 372363], [115, 372793], [119, 372933]]}, {"verse": 45, "start": 373954, "end": 381250, "text": "Y cuando vino, se acercó luego a él, y le dice: Maestro, Maestro. Y le besó.", "words": [[0, 373954], [2, 374056], [9, 374276], [15, 374736], [18, 375476], [25, 376136], [31, 376476], [33, 376856], [37, 377176], [39, 377876], [42, 378016], [48, 378799], [57, 379398], [66, 380538], [68, 380702], [71, 380782]]}, {"verse": 46, "start": 381700, "end": 385491, "text": "Entonces ellos echaron en él sus manos, y le prendieron.", "words": [[0, 381700], [9, 382237], [15, 382777], [23, 383457], [26, 383637], [29, 383817], [33, 383957], [40, 384337], [42, 384577], [45, 384697]]}, {"verse": 47, "start": 385941, "end": 393124, "text": "Y uno de los que estaban allí, sacando la espada, hirió al siervo del sumo sacerdote, y le cortó la oreja.", "words": [[0, 385941], [2, 386083], [6, 386263], [9, 386403], [13, 386523], [17, 386663], [25, 386963], [31, 387563], [39, 388043], [42, 388203], [50, 388793], [56, 389383], [59, 389753], [66, 390123], [70, 390263], [75, 390703], [86, 391363], [88, 391763], [91, 391883], [97, 392343], [100, 392463]]}, {"verse": 48, "start": 393574, "end": 400825, "text": "Y respondiendo Jesús, les dijo: ¿Cómo contra un bandido habéis salido con espadas y con palos a tomarme?", "words": [[0, 393574], [2, 393698], [15, 394458], [22, 394818], [26, 395198], [32, 396028], [38, 396446], [45, 396886], [48, 397066], [56, 397626], [63, 398006], [70, 398426], [74, 398666], [82, 399186], [84, 399386], [88, 399586], [94, 400026], [96, 400146]]}, {"verse": 49, "start": 401275, "end": 409742, "text": "Cada día estaba con vosotros enseñando en el templo, y no me tomasteis; pero es así, para que se cumplan las Escrituras.", "words": [[0, 401275], [5, 401555], [9, 401895], [16, 402275], [20, 402575], [29, 403075], [39, 403915], [42, 404035], [45, 404175], [53, 404975], [55, 405115], [58, 405275], [61, 405415], [72, 406639], [77, 406801], [80, 407001], [85, 407301], [90, 407601], [94, 407761], [97, 407941], [105, 408521], [109, 408721]]}, {"verse": 50, "start": 410192, "end": 414094, "text": "Entonces dejándole todos sus discípulos, huyeron.", "words": [[0, 410192], [9, 411177], [19, 411917], [25, 412177], [29, 412497], [41, 413297]]}, {"verse": 51, "start": 414544, "end": 421828, "text": "Pero un joven le seguía cubierto de una sábana sobre el cuerpo desnudo; y los jóvenes le prendieron:", "words": [[0, 414544], [5, 414669], [8, 414809], [14, 415229], [17, 415389], [24, 415829], [33, 416389], [36, 416569], [40, 416709], [47, 417289], [53, 417849], [56, 418129], [63, 418529], [72, 419755], [74, 419864], [78, 419984], [86, 420484], [89, 420964]]}, {"verse": 52, "start": 422278, "end": 426128, "text": "Pero él, dejando la sábana, se huyó de ellos desnudo.", "words": [[0, 422278], [5, 422426], [9, 422826], [17, 423166], [20, 423346], [28, 424326], [31, 424486], [36, 424826], [39, 424986], [45, 425246]]}, {"verse": 53, "start": 426578, "end": 436026, "text": "Y trajeron a Jesús al sumo sacerdote; y se juntaron a él todos los principales sacerdotes y los ancianos y los escribas.", "words": [[0, 426578], [2, 426677], [11, 427277], [13, 427337], [19, 427677], [22, 428037], [27, 428537], [38, 429755], [40, 430015], [43, 430135], [52, 430855], [54, 430995], [57, 431175], [63, 431795], [67, 432155], [79, 432935], [90, 433795], [92, 433995], [96, 434175], [105, 434855], [107, 435015], [111, 435175]]}, {"verse": 54, "start": 436476, "end": 446486, "text": "Pero Pedro le siguió de lejos hasta dentro del patio del sumo sacerdote; y estaba sentado con los servidores, y calentándose al fuego.", "words": [[0, 436476], [5, 436640], [11, 437180], [14, 437460], [21, 437900], [24, 438000], [30, 438580], [36, 439040], [43, 439460], [47, 439760], [53, 440260], [57, 440700], [62, 441280], [73, 442483], [75, 442571], [82, 442891], [90, 443471], [94, 443651], [98, 443811], [110, 444411], [112, 444891], [125, 445751], [128, 445891]]}, {"verse": 55, "start": 446936, "end": 456589, "text": "Y los principales sacerdotes y todo el Consejo buscaban testimonio contra Jesús, para entregarle a la muerte; pero no lo hallaban.", "words": [[0, 446936], [2, 447034], [6, 447154], [18, 447974], [29, 448714], [31, 448914], [36, 449234], [39, 449434], [47, 450014], [56, 450514], [67, 451254], [74, 451574], [81, 451994], [86, 453414], [97, 454114], [99, 454194], [102, 454294], [110, 455312], [115, 455382], [118, 455502], [121, 456072]]}, {"verse": 56, "start": 457039, "end": 463181, "text": "Porque muchos decían falso testimonio contra él; pero sus testimonios no coincidían.", "words": [[0, 457039], [7, 457379], [14, 457659], [21, 458219], [27, 458719], [38, 459479], [45, 459799], [49, 460598], [54, 460998], [58, 461198], [70, 461898], [73, 462058]]}, {"verse": 57, "start": 463631, "end": 469668, "text": "Entonces levantándose unos, dieron falso testimonio contra él, diciendo:", "words": [[0, 463631], [9, 464554], [22, 465294], [28, 465674], [35, 466294], [41, 466854], [52, 467694], [59, 468034], [63, 468674]]}, {"verse": 58, "start": 469918, "end": 478268, "text": "Nosotros le hemos oído decir: Yo derribaré este templo hecho por manos humanas, y en tres días edificaré otro no hecho por manos humanas.", "words": [[0, 469918], [9, 470325], [12, 470505], [18, 470685], [23, 471045], [30, 471870], [33, 471969], [43, 472449], [48, 472689], [55, 473189], [61, 473389], [65, 473589], [71, 473829], [80, 474669], [82, 474809], [85, 474949], [90, 475189], [95, 475469], [105, 476269], [110, 476649], [113, 476889], [119, 477129], [123, 477329], [129, 477569]]}, {"verse": 59, "start": 478618, "end": 482425, "text": "Pero ni aun así coincidía el testimonio de ellos.", "words": [[0, 478618], [5, 478924], [8, 479264], [12, 479464], [16, 479824], [26, 480664], [29, 480824], [40, 481584], [43, 481724]]}, {"verse": 60, "start": 482875, "end": 493735, "text": "Entonces el sumo sacerdote, levantándose en medio, preguntó a Jesús, diciendo: ¿No respondes algo? ¿Qué atestiguan estos contra ti?", "words": [[0, 482875], [9, 484340], [12, 484900], [17, 485320], [28, 486140], [41, 487080], [44, 487280], [51, 487980], [60, 488460], [62, 488480], [69, 488780], [79, 490030], [83, 490250], [93, 490970], [99, 491818], [104, 491934], [115, 492634], [121, 492874], [128, 493334]]}, {"verse": 61, "start": 494085, "end": 502207, "text": "Pero él callaba, y nada respondía. El sumo sacerdote le volvió a preguntar, y le dice: ¿Eres tú el Cristo, el Hijo del Bendito?", "words": [[0, 494085], [5, 494247], [8, 494407], [17, 494907], [19, 495067], [24, 495247], [35, 496484], [38, 496609], [43, 497029], [53, 497609], [56, 497769], [63, 498149], [65, 498169], [76, 498749], [78, 498829], [81, 498929], [87, 499693], [93, 499933], [96, 500193], [99, 500353], [107, 501113], [110, 501193], [115, 501393], [119, 501828]]}, {"verse": 62, "start": 502557, "end": 512419, "text": "Y Jesús le dijo: Yo soy; y veréis al Hijo del hombre sentado a la derecha del poder de Dios, y viniendo en las nubes del cielo.", "words": [[0, 502557], [2, 502680], [8, 503060], [11, 503460], [17, 504286], [20, 504534], [25, 505474], [27, 505613], [34, 506053], [37, 506373], [42, 506693], [46, 506893], [53, 507353], [61, 508033], [63, 508173], [66, 508253], [74, 508693], [78, 508853], [84, 509233], [87, 509493], [93, 509833], [95, 510293], [104, 510853], [107, 510973], [111, 511113], [117, 511573], [121, 511733]]}, {"verse": 63, "start": 512869, "end": 520150, "text": "Entonces el sumo sacerdote, rasgando sus vestidos, dijo: ¿Qué más tenemos necesidad de testigos?", "words": [[0, 512869], [9, 513454], [12, 513754], [17, 514214], [28, 515334], [37, 515954], [41, 516214], [51, 517254], [57, 517968], [62, 518068], [66, 518308], [74, 518668], [84, 519308], [87, 519428]]}, {"verse": 64, "start": 520600, "end": 527248, "text": "Oído habéis la blasfemia: ¿qué os parece? Y ellos todos lo condenaron como merecedor de muerte.", "words": [[0, 520757], [5, 520952], [12, 521147], [15, 521342], [26, 522331], [31, 522431], [34, 522551], [42, 523421], [44, 523568], [50, 523828], [56, 524228], [59, 524608], [70, 525328], [75, 525628], [85, 526388], [88, 526528]]}, {"verse": 65, "start": 527698, "end": 538315, "text": "Y algunos comenzaron a escupir en él, y cubrir su rostro, y a darle bofetadas, y decirle: Profetiza. Y los servidores le herían de bofetadas.", "words": [[0, 527698], [2, 527786], [10, 528086], [21, 528766], [23, 528866], [31, 529346], [34, 529466], [38, 529686], [40, 530506], [47, 530926], [50, 531146], [58, 531706], [60, 531826], [62, 532016], [68, 532206], [79, 532886], [81, 533326], [90, 534269], [101, 535353], [103, 535459], [107, 535599], [118, 536279], [121, 536759], [128, 537159], [131, 537319]]}, {"verse": 66, "start": 538765, "end": 544514, "text": "Y estando Pedro abajo en el patio, vino una de las criadas del sumo sacerdote;", "words": [[0, 538765], [2, 539085], [10, 539405], [16, 539725], [22, 540065], [25, 540265], [28, 540385], [35, 541445], [40, 541805], [44, 542205], [47, 542345], [51, 542505], [59, 542985], [63, 543185], [68, 543625]]}, {"verse": 67, "start": 544964, "end": 551413, "text": "Y cuando vio a Pedro que se calentaba, mirándole, dice: Y tú con Jesús el nazareno estabas.", "words": [[0, 544964], [2, 545305], [9, 545525], [13, 545865], [15, 545945], [21, 546185], [25, 546405], [28, 546525], [39, 547365], [50, 547905], [56, 548773], [58, 548900], [61, 549140], [65, 549440], [71, 549840], [74, 550200], [83, 550740]]}, {"verse": 68, "start": 551763, "end": 559403, "text": "Pero él negó, diciendo: No conozco, ni sé lo que dices. Y se salió fuera a la entrada; y cantó el gallo.", "words": [[0, 551763], [5, 551930], [8, 552270], [14, 552830], [24, 553813], [27, 553939], [36, 554479], [39, 554619], [42, 554819], [45, 554939], [49, 555059], [56, 555980], [58, 556084], [61, 556204], [67, 556624], [73, 556744], [75, 556864], [78, 557204], [87, 558211], [89, 558358], [95, 558648], [98, 558938]]}, {"verse": 69, "start": 559853, "end": 565779, "text": "Y la criada viéndole otra vez, comenzó a decir a los que estaban allí: Este es de ellos.", "words": [[0, 559853], [2, 560133], [5, 560253], [12, 560713], [21, 561233], [26, 561453], [31, 561753], [39, 562433], [41, 562513], [47, 562893], [49, 563153], [53, 563273], [57, 563393], [65, 563693], [71, 564489], [76, 564814], [79, 565074], [82, 565274]]}, {"verse": 70, "start": 566129, "end": 579614, "text": "Pero él negó otra vez. Y poco después, los que estaban allí dijeron otra vez a Pedro: Verdaderamente tú eres de ellos; porque eres galileo, y tu manera de hablar es semejante a la de ellos.", "words": [[0, 566129], [5, 566293], [8, 566633], [13, 567093], [18, 567433], [23, 568322], [25, 568603], [30, 568943], [39, 569583], [43, 570003], [47, 570143], [55, 570463], [60, 570803], [68, 571683], [73, 571923], [77, 572223], [79, 572363], [86, 573140], [101, 573943], [104, 574223], [109, 574443], [112, 574623], [119, 575509], [126, 575745], [131, 576005], [140, 576705], [142, 577065], [145, 577185], [152, 577425], [155, 577645], [162, 577925], [165, 578245], [175, 578765], [177, 578865], [180, 578925], [183, 579065]]}, {"verse": 71, "start": 579964, "end": 584890, "text": "Y él comenzó a maldecir y a jurar: No conozco a este hombre de quien habláis.", "words": [[0, 579964], [2, 580130], [5, 580250], [13, 580870], [15, 580970], [24, 581590], [26, 581790], [28, 581870], [35, 582722], [38, 582867], [46, 583347], [48, 583427], [53, 583587], [60, 583867], [63, 584067], [69, 584227]]}, {"verse": 72, "start": 585240, "end": 598572, "text": "Y el gallo cantó la segunda vez: y Pedro se acordó de las palabras que Jesús le había dicho: Antes que el gallo cante dos veces, me negarás tres veces. Y pensando en esto, lloraba.", "words": [[0, 585240], [2, 585344], [5, 585484], [11, 585824], [17, 586264], [20, 586384], [28, 586744], [33, 587650], [35, 587794], [41, 588234], [44, 588714], [51, 589254], [54, 589334], [58, 589474], [67, 589874], [71, 590114], [77, 590434], [80, 590794], [86, 590994], [93, 591837], [99, 592161], [103, 592341], [106, 592461], [112, 592801], [118, 593161], [122, 593301], [129, 593981], [132, 594161], [140, 594581], [145, 594781], [152, 595832], [154, 595956], [163, 596376], [166, 596636], [172, 597656]]}]}